# Cloud Build source-upload gcloudignore — exclude everything that's
# either generated locally or downloaded at build time.
# Target: keep source upload under 30 MiB.
#
# What's NEEDED at runtime (kept):
#   - baml_extracts/ + baml_extracts_education/ + baml_src (symlink)
#   - data/ireland/ncca_policy/*.pdf (the 5 certificate source-of-truth PDFs)
#   - themes/ (palette JSONs)
#   - gemini_hackathon/, gemini_hackathon_backend/, gemini_hackathon_gradio/, gemini_hackathon_assets_fibo/
#   - functions/ (Firebase Functions source)
#   - hf_spaces/ (Space templates)
#   - web/ (frontend — Firebase Hosting deploys separately but the build context needs it)
#
# What's EXCLUDED:
#   - .venv, .venv-secrets, __pycache__, .pytest_cache, .ruff_cache, .mypy_cache
#   - data/ireland/leaving_certificate/ (the 139 LC PDFs — downloaded at runtime via DLT)
#   - data/England/, data/Scotland/, data/Wales/, data/Northern Ireland/, data/J Jersey/,
#     data/Guernsey/, data/Isle of Man/, data/leabharlann/ (the 8 other jurisdictions —
#     downloaded at runtime via DLT)
#   - data/bi_ep/extracted_syllabi.sqlite + data/bi_ep/syllabi_md/ + annotated_learning_graphs/
#     (regenerated at runtime via CocoIndex)
#   - data/lancedb/ (regenerated at runtime)
#   - baml_client/ (regenerated by step 0)
#   - notebooks/ + docs/ (not needed for backend image)
#   - .git/, .env, secrets.yaml.local

# Local venvs
.venv/
.venv-secrets/

# Caches + pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.coverage
.coverage.*

# Generated content (regenerated by step 0)
baml_client/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/

# Heavy data — exclude jurisdictions that are downloaded at runtime via DLT
data/England/
data/Scotland/
data/Wales/
data/Northern Ireland/
data/Jersey/
data/Guernsey/
data/Isle of Man/
data/leabharlann/
data/ireland/leaving_certificate/

# Generated data artefacts
data/bi_ep/extracted_syllabi.sqlite
data/bi_ep/syllabi_md/
data/bi_ep/annotated_learning_graphs/
data/bi_ep/learning_graphs/
data/lancedb/

# Keep ONLY: data/ireland/ncca_policy/ (the 5 certificate PDFs)

# Notebooks + docs (not needed for backend image)
notebooks/
docs/

# Git + editor artefacts
.git/
.gitignore
.DS_Store
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/

# Subagent scratch
.hypothesis/

# Local secrets (use GSM in production)
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
secrets.yaml.local

# CI + openspec working dirs (the spec deltas aren't needed at runtime)
openspec/specs/
openspec/changes/archive/
openspec/INDEX.md
openspec/AGENTS.md